> Self Image – The idea one has of one�[�]s abilities, appearance, and personality.
Maintaining a positive self-image can be really difficult. I know, personally, I have always struggled with this. I say “self-image” instead of �[�]body image” because I believe it�[�]s important to love all of yourself. Your style, your taste, your views, your abilities, your personality. There is a word that I feel has maybe fallen on the back burner these days and that word is IND[IV]IDUAL. You are you, and there is not a single person out there who is exactly like you. That is something to celebrate, not something to shy away from.
